@OrderProcessingService.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5086

### Create an order. Idempotency-Key is required; repeat the same key + body to get the original outcome replayed
### (response header Idempotent-Replayed: true). Same key with a different body -> 422; still running -> 409.
POST {{OrderProcessingService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 7d1f6c52-3f0a-4a53-9c1e-0d6a1f2b9a10

{
  "customerId": "customer-1",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "PROD-001", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 30.00 }
  ]
}

### Missing Idempotency-Key -> 400
POST {{OrderProcessingService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-1",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "PROD-001", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 10.00 }
  ]
}

###
